yYXpIeENuTk45dV8wUkZDaWwwMnY4Z3AwSW1WQmhfcGxvZWZKUllVLVJlckhQc200cGMxeTFrOEM1WFJYbFptMnlQUDNMbVZLdmtxUlpsQw?oc=5"},{"d":"2026-10-16T22:53:36+00:00","o":"BVM Sports","t":"Daily Faceoff's Anthony Di Marco On Travis Konecny Trade Report, Flyers Rumors, Trevor Zegras & More","u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPdnZXS2F3SXRpMkNrbW1kUkxCaVFJc0QwdUI4enFBVXRvZjhla0lDTHBiZnNZWU03UTVIR3B1cmFPZjdlT1B4Z1BPVXhuZXowd05UcUg2WW9IY0E4ZU5ldExtRGVVOVZwNDZ5bmM5aFVmSFc2bERUQnc2ZVhFRERXb2hfenhHZTRTcDJ5WHdIWWo3VjRicnpIeGRhSEpUSGhqeHhJYW9ndV9ldnc3elp4TXlVX2JfQzhiS29HMENERVdfNnVlWjFFYQ?oc=5"}],"posts":[{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-11-01T23:03:27+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"Great forechecking work and battle from the Dvorak line, eventually leads to Konecny finding Dvorak in the slot for a point-blank grade-A opportunity and goal. 4-1 Flyers.\n\nWhere has this battle level been the rest of this season?","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3mzbw6ruy322r"},{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-11-01T22:42:42+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"Flyers up 3-1 after two periods. Travis Konecny really made his presence felt in that one. Was flying all over the ice, stirring the pot and producing offense (including a goal).","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3mzbuzoxgvc2r"},{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-11-01T22:17:56+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"Konecny is really bringing the energy in the 2nd period that this team has lacked in too many games this year.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3mzbtnfxaak2r"},{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-11-01T22:14:56+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"Travis Konecny bulldozed Artem Duda after Duda took down Zegras awkwardly. Unfortunately, in the process, he knocked Duda right into Zegras' head.\n\nKonecny's heart was certainly in the right place. Zegras is back on the bench now, so looks like no serious harm done.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3mzbthzvxcc2r"},{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-11-01T22:08:09+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"Travis Konecny scores in his return to the lineup. Fluky goal -- he just tossed it out in front from below the goal line and it bounced in -- but hey, he was funneling pucks to the net, and it came after two straight strong Flyers shifts. 2-1 Flyers.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3mzbt3vzabc2r"},{"a":"Daily Faceoff","d":"2026-11-01T20:48:28+00:00","h":"dailyfaceoff.bsky.social","o":"Daily Faceoff","t":"Flyers activate Travis Konecny, Owen Tippett off injured reserve","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/dailyfaceoff.bsky.social/post/3mzbongu7if24"},{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-11-01T20:32:46+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"As expected, Tippett and Konecny are on the ice for warmups. They're back today.\n\nCole Knuble is on the ice for warmups, and I don't see Michael Bunting. So it looks like Bunting will be the forward scratch. That was still up in the air based on practice lines yesterday.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3mzbnre6h322r"},{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-10-30T17:40:34+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"Tocchet didn't rule out the possibility of both Konecny and Tippett being ready for Sunday's game vs. Utah. He said it depends on how the next few days go, but \"they're now day-to-day more than ever. It's getting close.\"","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3mz4d7lxrh22f"},{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-10-30T16:26:37+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"Konecny might be wearing the non contact jersey today, but he's getting some contact right now in battle drills. I assume that's a good sign of how he's felt so far in this practice.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3mz473e3uwc2g"},{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-10-30T15:44:56+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"Travis Konecny is on the ice today in a yellow non contact jersey.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3mz44qt64xc2g"}],"team":"PHI","threads":[{"d":"2026-11-01T22:15:56+00:00","sub":"hockey","t":"Travis Konecny throws the puck to the net and bounces it in off the defender for his 1st of the season.","u":"https://www.reddit.com/r/hockey/comments/1xlg48v/travis_konecny_throws_the_puck_to_the_net_and/"},{"d":"2026-10-30T15:48:22+00:00","sub":"Flyers","t":"[Spiegel] #Flyers practice getting underway on split rinks. Travis Konecny is on one, with other forwards, in a yellow no-touch jersey.","u":"https://www.reddit.com/r/Flyers/comments/1xjiyk1/spiegel_flyers_practice_getting_underway_on_split/"}],"videos":[]}